factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script says 'நவம்பர் 24ஆம் தேதி' (November 24) and the slides say 'நவ.24' — the article only says 'இன்று (நவ.,24)', so the date itself is supported; no issue there.
  The reel_script states the Karthigai Deepam was lit at Matheswaran hill ('மாதேஸ்வரன் மலை மீது கார்த்திகை தீபம் ஏற்றப்பட்டது'), but the article only says the Parani deepam was lit in front of the temple, not on the hill; the hill-top lighting is an overstatement/invented detail.
  The slides_spec 'என்ன நடந்தது?' slide says 'இன்று நவ.24 சிறப்பு பூஜைகள் செய்யப்பட்டன', which mixes the date into the event sentence in an awkward, partly unclear way; the sentence reads as if the date itself was the event.
  The slides_spec 'எங்கே?' slide describes the temple as 'மாதேஸ்வரன் மலை மீது உள்ள பழமையான கோயில்' which is supported, but the caption and headline additionally call the event 'மாதேஸ்வரன் மலை மீது கார்த்திகை தீபம்', an inconsistent description of where the lamp was lit compared with the article.
  The reel_script omits the key fact that the Karthigai Deepam festival (கார்த்திகை தீப விழா) was being celebrated at the temple itself, while it mentions only the Parani deepam; the explicit festival framing is partly lost in the reel script.
